      "replacement": "Use the exact version tag when reporting a regression. The 1.7.1 GA image retains the `1.7.1-rc.6` build identity because promotion reuses the tested image. Use `1.7-rc` only when you intentionally want each candidate cut without editing your Compose file.\n",
